        <p>"Why do you want tw-079 "asked the Chairman of the Stratford magistiates of a man who applied for two vaccination exemption certificates. " Twins, sir," explained the applicant. "I had twins last time, as well." "You are a lucky man," remarked the Chairman. "I don't think so," responded the applicant gloomily.</p>
