        <p>Peptolaxa is not for babies only. It is for children of all ages. It is laxative, comforting, digestive. It cures Fever, it cures Diarrhcea, it cures Constipation, makes teething painless. A smile in every dose. Mrs. Hemingbrough, 19, Gloucester-avenue, Armley- road, Leeds, writes : —"I have been persuaded to give your Peptolaxa a trial for my three chil- dren, who required a corrective medicine which the children's powders sold for that purpose did not seem to supply. Their ages are six, four, and one year. Each took the tablets very readily, and they have immensely benefited by them. lam quite satisfied that there is not a children's remedy which could have been so satisfactory, and in all ordinary ailments in future I shall not think of trying anything else. Every- one should know how reliable Peptolaxa is, particularly in children's fevers and teething troubles." Peptolaxa should he in every mother's hand, to the exclusion of the old-fashioned, unscientific household medicines. Price Is. 11d. It can be had at all branches of Boots', Cash Chemists. Dr. Williams' Medicine Co., Holborn-viaduct, London, will send a free sample on request.</p>
