        <p>MRS. FOULDES' FORTUNE! • A little story of the happiness that came to a Lancashire Mother. The story told by Mrs. Isabella Fouldes, of 6, "I went to a chemist's in Atherton and obtained Rivington-street,Howe Bridge, near Atherton, Lan- a box of Iron-Ox Tablets. Before I had completed cashire, to a local journalist, who called upon her the first box I began to feel relieved. I was , to hear from her own lips what she had to say as - delighted. I took three more boxes, and the to her experience of Iron-Ox Tablets, is most re- improvement went on. The pains gradually left me. markable. My appetite which had practically gone, returned. I could eat more substantial food than before; I The reporter relates his interview as follows got gradually stronger ; and by the time I had taken : the seventh box I was a new woman s6rong, healthy, called unexpectedly at the house occupied by Mrs. Fouldes. It is one of a row of modern cottages happy again." built a little distance away from the main road, and faces open fields. The house was very ciean, and "I used to be so bad that I thought I had heart comfortably furnished. Mrs. Fouldes looked in disease. Oh, bow grand I felt after the fourth box. good health, was very bright and conversational, Before commencing with the Iron-Ox Tablets I had and evidently a person of good education, no appetite at all. I was always sleepy. I could sleep till dinner time, and after dinner I wanted to go to sleep again. Then I suffered a great deal from neuralgia. The pains used to be from my left shoulder to the back of my neck. Those pains have all disappeared." "I have taken eight boxes of the Tablets altogether." "My son, 7 years of age, used to be a little sufferer from biliousness, but after taking a few of the Iron-Ox Tablets he rapidly improved, and he is now the picture of good health. He is out playing flow; I wish you could see him." "It has afforded me great pleasure to recommend the Iron-Ox tablets to all who suffered froni any of the complaints that I was troubled with for so many years, and people that I have so recommended them to are taking them now." "I am glad to give you this testimony to the value of the Iron-Ox tablets, and you can make what use of it you please."</p>
